Rules:
- NEVER mimic summary format, use the `{{.SummarizedContentPrefix}}` prefix, or call `{{.SummarizationToolName}}` yourself
- NEVER produce plain-text responses simulating tool calls -- always use structured tool calls
- Analyze summarized failures before re-attempting similar actions
